When you have a professional headshot, drop it here as `hamid-hero.jpg`.

Recommended:
- Aspect ratio: 4:5 (portrait) — that's what the hero card expects
- Resolution: 1200×1500 minimum (the card scales to ~480×600 on desktop)
- Crop: head-and-shoulders, eyes at upper third, plain or softly blurred background
- File size: <300KB after compression (use squoosh.app or imageoptim)
- Format: jpg (smaller for photos than png)

The hero will pick it up automatically. The HK monogram fallback art shown
right now hides itself the moment the file exists. No code change needed.

If you want me to crop / compress an existing photo, drop it here and ask.
